Collections:
1.  Collections framework for list of classes and interfaces that are tested data structures and algorithms.
2.  All collections are derived from java.util.Collection interface.
3.  Collection interface extends Iterable interface that has an iterator.
4.  Calling iterator() method on any collection will return an iterator object.

